					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Kind of funny actually.<br />Had a run in with some clowns from LoS in KC during the weekend some Necro named Talbone and an enchanter named Mezmeralda i think the name was. Guess they kill bert and agnarr and think they all uber now.</div>
