					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">No what he is saying is they wanted the mob but couldn&#039;t kill it but they were there first so there.&nbsp; It doesn&#039;t happen that way either you have the group there ready to kill it or you get the hell out of the way becuase you can&#039;t win.&nbsp; It&#039;s not called KSing its called stalling till you can get someone there.&nbsp; If anyone should be black listed it you for stalling and then throwing a temper tantrum like a little baby when you get told to sit down and shut up.&nbsp; YOu never had a claim to that mob its not like damn or cleric went LD can we have a min to see if he comes back.&nbsp; That is a legit excuse for asking for a min to keep a mob your not attacking.&nbsp; Not he the cleric dipped on us and we need a tank and we can&#039;t kill can you wait till we get people that can.&nbsp; So now your gonna come here and attempt to Black List someone when your stall tactics failed and you think you are owed something.&nbsp;  :BS:&nbsp; 8)&nbsp; :veryangry:</div>
