					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Nope, wasn&#039;t there. I just happen to know Nost,  and find it very unlikley that he would say&quot; Watch me out DPS your group&quot;. <br /><br />I&#039;m posting because what regardless of what I saw, you calling the whole zone is BS. It might have been funny if you said &quot;the whole zone&quot; and then really stated what camp you were at.  <br /><br />The reason I even bothered posting is you continued to be a &quot;funny guy&quot; after he asked twice in ooc, and when he was nice enough to ask to be put on a list you still continued to be an ass hat.  If he did say what you claimed, then you more than likley deserved it for being annoying.</div>
