					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: Dang Fabled and being KSed</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Soupy Sales</b> on <b>April 01, 2005, 05:03:07 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">just to derail this thread to the core problem with fabled...Every one against lists (remember there used to be waiting lists to get into the regular fbss group because it was camped 24/7), seems to have a guild to back them up.<br /><br />I view these lists as giant pick up raids. I think they&#039;re a good thing, that allow solo people a chance to get loot otherwise out of their reach. Just because one or two people abuse the system doesn&#039;t mean it should be scraped. I alternated with my brother last year for just a touch of 24 hours to get his 59th ranger the fabled fbss. I don&#039;t think there were more than 3 or 4 people under 50th in the line while i was there (20 people or so on the list at all times) and most of those were alts that logged on higher level guys to help with the kill.<br /><br />Contrary to what alot of you pixilated personalities think, it doesn&#039;t hurt you to be nice to those that don&#039;t have the guild tag you have. Just because you can envoke PnP doesn&#039;t mean you should.</div>
					<br />
