					Post by: <b>Elvyn</b> on <b>April 11, 2005, 08:07:43 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">Even a GM would concider you silly if you tried to claim you where camping a mob just because you had agro on it</div><br /><br />i tried camping one of these GM mobs a long time ago but could only get 2 to spawn in one year. Doesnt drop anything and it keeps saying &quot;we will look into it&quot; and &quot;there&#039;s nothing i can do&quot;. Not sure if they&#039;ve been nerfed.</div>
